      <workList xml:id="workDesc_N20373">
         <work xml:id="work_d1e221218">
            <identifier label="SchW" xml:id="identifier_N2037D">A2:005</identifier>
            <title xml:id="title_bb0bd7e2" xml:lang="it">Sinfonia a 4 ex A dur</title>
            <contributor xml:id="respStmt_N20385">
               <persName role="composer" xml:id="persName_2ebf4c0d">Johann Adolph Scheibe</persName>
            </contributor>
            <history xml:id="history_defe1aa0">
               <p xml:id="idm135">Though the physical evidence suggests that the present sinfonia was copied by a professional at the end of the eighteenth century and presumably sold by a music dealer or publishing house, it seems likely that it was composed during Scheibe's early career. Apparently it was part of a larger collection as 'No. 18' has been added on the original title page.</p>
            </history>
